      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MOHAWK PARK (7) was responsible for a far better performance last time out when he scored by 3.5 metres over 1720m at Dubbo. May need luck at some stage extracting from the inside of the second row. Meets a comparable field so he can make it two on the bounce. ALTIANO (1) went back last start and failed to threaten when 15 metres from the winner in seventh at Dubbo over 1720m. That effort followed a nice fourth at Young two runs ago. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Primary contender if he is on-song. IRK MCGLURK (5) is right in contention after finishing in the placings for the second time in a row last start, beaten 2.75 metres into third at Dubbo. No reason he cannot take this out. BROOKLYN BANDIT (2) showed pleasing improvement last time out when runner-up over 1720m at Dubbo. Each-way claims.",
